    "detailed_description": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of Ernest Sheffield, a technician, and one of many staff employed by the enormous Luminary Corporation on the distant world of Marzanna. It's been steady work for two years, but everything is about to fall apart.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear, hand-crafted levels with room to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a variety of twisted monsters, each new area bringing something new</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple inventory management. Collect items, but don\u2019t worry about weight or limited space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focus on building tension and atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Straightforward puzzles that don't rely on moon logic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/a64735f88842ab466cf748124bb81c52.poster.avif?t=1755470963\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/a64735f88842ab466cf748124bb81c52.webm?t=1755470963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/a64735f88842ab466cf748124bb81c52.mp4?t=1755470963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your surroundings to find useful items. Search dark corners for stims, lost key fobs, vital notes, and other tools that might keep you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/922815890a7f03787c35fc6cc5ec4310.poster.avif?t=1755470963\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/922815890a7f03787c35fc6cc5ec4310.webm?t=1755470963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/922815890a7f03787c35fc6cc5ec4310.mp4?t=1755470963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many dangers inside the collapsing facility, and Ernest isn\u2019t a soldier. Stay hidden, stay smart, and when things go bad, run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/c21a24f9ebad9ad3434471c6e33d5d3b.poster.avif?t=1755470963\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/c21a24f9ebad9ad3434471c6e33d5d3b.webm?t=1755470963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/c21a24f9ebad9ad3434471c6e33d5d3b.mp4?t=1755470963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits and technical know-how to push forward, from unlocking doors to restarting a failing reactor.</p>",
    "about_the_game": "<h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Overview</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Take the role of Ernest Sheffield, a technician, and one of many staff employed by the enormous Luminary Corporation on the distant world of Marzanna. It's been steady work for two years, but everything is about to fall apart.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Features</strong></h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Linear, hand-crafted levels with room to explore</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Face a variety of twisted monsters, each new area bringing something new</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Simple inventory management. Collect items, but don\u2019t worry about weight or limited space</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >A focus on building tension and atmosphere</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Straightforward puzzles that don't rely on moon logic</p></li></ul><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Explore</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/a64735f88842ab466cf748124bb81c52.poster.avif?t=1755470963\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/a64735f88842ab466cf748124bb81c52.webm?t=1755470963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/a64735f88842ab466cf748124bb81c52.mp4?t=1755470963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore your surroundings to find useful items. Search dark corners for stims, lost key fobs, vital notes, and other tools that might keep you alive.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Evade</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/922815890a7f03787c35fc6cc5ec4310.poster.avif?t=1755470963\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/922815890a7f03787c35fc6cc5ec4310.webm?t=1755470963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/922815890a7f03787c35fc6cc5ec4310.mp4?t=1755470963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >There are many dangers inside the collapsing facility, and Ernest isn\u2019t a soldier. Stay hidden, stay smart, and when things go bad, run.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ><strong>Progress</strong></h2><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><span class=\"bb_img_ctn\"><video class=\"bb_img\" autoplay muted loop playsinline poster=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/c21a24f9ebad9ad3434471c6e33d5d3b.poster.avif?t=1755470963\" width=600 height=300 ><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/c21a24f9ebad9ad3434471c6e33d5d3b.webm?t=1755470963\" type=\"video/webm; codecs=vp9\"><source src=\"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3353810/extras/c21a24f9ebad9ad3434471c6e33d5d3b.mp4?t=1755470963\" type=\"video/mp4\"></video></span></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Use your wits and technical know-how to push forward, from unlocking doors to restarting a failing reactor.</p>",
